Make Recast's detail-mesh arithmetic match BuildNav's RecastDemo.exe.

Upstream's Windows RecastDemo project builds with /fp:fast (RecastDemo/premake5.lua), and MSVC
rewrote three float expressions in buildPolyDetail. The disassembly of the exe shows the forms
below; each line here is the exe's arithmetic, in strict IEEE float. The first two change zone 0's
detail meshes. The jitter form makes no difference there, but it is what the exe computes.

diff --git a/Recast/Source/RecastMeshDetail.cpp b/Recast/Source/RecastMeshDetail.cpp
index 40d350f..f9d05f9 100644
